+| Sentence median | 11 | 10.0 | Near target, one word short. |
+| Population SD | ~26 | 10.95 | Materially narrower than the selected target; the prose has less sentence-length spread even though its long-sentence share is correct. |
+| Sentences ≤5 words | 27.7% / up to ~34% | 25.2% | Slightly below target; not a material defect by itself. |
+| Sentences ≥40 words | 3.3% / 2.5–4.5% | 3.4% | On target and within range. |
